				<guid>https://kowalcj0.github.io/2026/07/21/mpris2awtrix/</guid>
				<description>&lt;link rel=&#34;stylesheet&#34; href=&#34;https://kowalcj0.github.io/css/photoswipe.min.css&#34; integrity=&#34;sha256-rlldBDOCxqXAE1fRopHG2SqpgWisq17/3Oleo+1CBKo=&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;link rel=&#34;stylesheet&#34; href=&#34;https://kowalcj0.github.io/css/photoswipe-default-skin.min.css&#34; integrity=&#34;sha256-kQW7k22C0skJMSPxgEI2VHR0LPHeygi8SRYNvV/DB2w=&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;script src=&#34;https://kowalcj0.github.io/js/photoswipe.min.js&#34; integrity=&#34;sha256-ePwmChbbvXbsO02lbM3HoHbSHTHFAeChekF1xKJdleo=&#34;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&lt;script src=&#34;https://kowalcj0.github.io/js/photoswipe-ui-default.min.js&#34; integrity=&#34;sha256-UKkzOn/w1mBxRmLLGrSeyB4e1xbrp4xylgAWb3M42pU=&#34;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;pswp&#34; tabindex=&#34;-1&#34; role=&#34;dialog&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;pswp__bg&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;pswp__scroll-wrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;pswp__container&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;pswp__item&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;pswp__item&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;pswp__item&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;pswp__ui pswp__ui--hidden&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;pswp__top-bar&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;pswp__counter&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button class=&#34;pswp__button pswp__button--close&#34; title=&#34;Close (Esc)&#34;&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button class=&#34;pswp__button pswp__button--share&#34; title=&#34;Share&#34;&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button class=&#34;pswp__button pswp__button--fs&#34; title=&#34;Toggle fullscreen&#34;&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button class=&#34;pswp__button pswp__button--zoom&#34; title=&#34;Zoom in/out&#34;&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &#xA;      &#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;pswp__preloader&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;pswp__preloader__icn&#34;&gt;&#xA;          &lt;div class=&#34;pswp__preloader__cut&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&#34;pswp__preloader__donut&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;          &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;pswp__share-modal pswp__share-modal--hidden pswp__single-tap&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;pswp__share-tooltip&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;button class=&#34;pswp__button pswp__button--arrow--left&#34; title=&#34;Previous (arrow left)&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/button&gt;&#xA;    &lt;button class=&#34;pswp__button pswp__button--arrow--right&#34; title=&#34;Next (arrow right)&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/button&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;pswp__caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;pswp__caption__center&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;script src=&#34;https://kowalcj0.github.io/js/jquery-3.4.1.min.js&#34; integrity=&#34;sha256-CSXorXvZcTkaix6Yvo6HppcZGetbYMGWSFlBw8HfCJo=&#34;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&lt;script src=&#34;https://kowalcj0.github.io/js/pswp-init.js&#34;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This guide configures your Ulanzi/Awtrix 3 display to show notifications with the currently playing track&amp;rsquo;s artist and title whenever a new song starts on any MPRIS-compatible media player (&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/jeffvli/feishin&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;Feishin&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;, Spotify, Firefox, VLC, etc.) on your Linux machine. It uses &lt;code&gt;dbus2mqtt&lt;/code&gt; to forward media player events over MQTT, which are then picked up by Home Assistant and sent to the Awtrix display.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Play videoclip for currently playing song in mpv</title>
				<link>https://kowalcj0.github.io/2018/03/29/get-song-title-from-dbus-via-mpris2-find-videoclip-with-ddgr-on-youtube-and-play-it-with-mpv/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 29 Mar 2018 15:15:14 +0100</pubDate>
				<guid>https://kowalcj0.github.io/2018/03/29/get-song-title-from-dbus-via-mpris2-find-videoclip-with-ddgr-on-youtube-and-play-it-with-mpv/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Short demo:&#xA;&lt;video width=&#34;100%&#34; autoplay loop itemscope itemtype=&#34;http://schema.org/VideoObject&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;source src=&#34;../mpd2mpv.mp4&#34; type=&#34;video/webm&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    Your browser does not support the video tag.&#xA;&lt;/video&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;requirements&#34;&gt;Requirements&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;You&amp;rsquo;ll need:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;python 3.x&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://mpv.io/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;mpv&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA; video player&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;music player that supports &lt;a href=&#34;https://specifications.freedesktop.org/mpris-spec/latest/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;MPRIS2 D-Bus interface&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.musicpd.org/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;mpd&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA; + &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/eonpatapon/mpDris2&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;mpDris2&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://deadbeef.sourceforge.net/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;deadbeef&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA; + &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/Serranya/deadbeef-mpris2-plugin&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;mpris2-plugin&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;some &lt;code&gt;D-Bus&lt;/code&gt; packages -&amp;gt; &lt;code&gt;dbus-devel dbus-python-devel dbus-glib-devel&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;&#34;&gt;ddgr&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/jarun/ddgr&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;https://github.com/jarun/ddgr&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA; - a CLI client for &lt;code&gt;DuckDuckGo&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;system-packages&#34;&gt;System packages&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Once you have your player &amp;amp; MPRIS2 installed &amp;amp; configured, install:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
